<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54835" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάπλεος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-πλέως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ω</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quite full</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span> of a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.568
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.498f
			</span></i>: <i>fouled, stained with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς τε κατάπλεων τὸ γένειον καὶ
					αἵματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.3.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.952.44
			</span></i> (Epid.); [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλῷ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.79
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>filled with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύχνος ὥσπερ κέγχροις πολλοῖς κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χωρίον ὀχετοῖς κατάπλεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Pun.</u>
					117
				</span></i>
			.</div>
